---
title: "Alcohol Delivery in Austin & Lakeway, TX | Monarch Liquor"
description: "Alcohol delivery and curbside pickup from Monarch Liquor's East Austin and Lakeway stores. Order spirits, wine, and beer online Mon–Sat 10am–9pm. 21+ with valid ID."
ogDescription: "Alcohol delivery and curbside pickup from Monarch Liquor's East Austin and Lakeway stores. Order online Mon–Sat 10am–9pm."
twitterDescription: "Alcohol delivery and curbside pickup from two Austin stores. Order online Mon–Sat 10am–9pm."
image: "/images/champagne-toast-1280.jpg"
sitemap: { priority: "0.9", changefreq: monthly }
schema:
  faqs: [delivery]
  stores: true
---
{%- set t = delivery.terms -%}
{%- set hoursLine = hoursLib.weeklySummary(business.hours)[0] -%}

    <!-- Page Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero page-hero--toast">
      <h1><em>Delivery &amp; Curbside</em></h1>
{%- if t.freeOver.confirmed %}
      <p>FREE DELIVERY OVER ${{ t.freeOver.amount }} &middot; {{ hoursLine | upper }}</p>
{%- else %}
      <p>ORDER ONLINE &middot; {{ hoursLine | upper }} &middot; TWO AUSTIN STORES</p>
{%- endif %}
      <p class="page-hero__actions">{% order "delivery-hero", "Start Your Order", "btn btn--primary" %}</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Answer block -->
    <section class="content-section delivery-intro">
      <div class="content-narrow">
        <p class="answer">Monarch Liquor delivers spirits, wine, and beer from two Austin stores, Monday through Saturday, {{ hoursLib.fmt12(business.hours.weekly.mon.open) }} to {{ hoursLib.fmt12(business.hours.weekly.mon.close) }}. Order online and choose delivery or curbside pickup. {% if delivery.zones[0].confirmed and delivery.zones[1].confirmed %}Our East Austin store serves {{ delivery.zones[0].label }}; our Lakeway store serves {{ delivery.zones[1].label }}.{% else %}Each store delivers to its own side of town.{% endif %} Every recipient must be 21 or older with a valid photo ID.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How It Works -->
    <section class="content-section content-section--alt">
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <span class="step-number">1</span>
          <h3>Shop Online</h3>
          <p>Browse the full shelf of both stores online. Spirits, wine, beer, mixers &mdash; if it's in the store, it's on the site.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <span class="step-number">2</span>
          <h3>We Pack Your Order</h3>
          <p>Our team hand-picks your bottles the moment your order comes in. Substitution requests? Leave a note and we'll call you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <span class="step-number">3</span>
          <h3>Delivered to Your Door</h3>
          <p>A Monarch driver brings it straight to you{% if t.sameDay.confirmed %} &mdash; usually the same day{% endif %}. Have your ID ready: every recipient must be 21+.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:40px;">
        {% order "delivery-steps", "Start Your Order", "btn-primary" %}
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Delivery at a glance -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Delivery at a Glance</h2>
      <div class="content-narrow">
        <dl class="terms-list">
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Hours</dt>
            <dd>{{ hoursLib.weeklySummary(business.hours) | join(" · ") }}. {{ business.hours.sundayNote }}.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Delivery fee</dt>
            <dd>{% if t.freeOver.confirmed %}{{ t.freeOver.text }} {{ t.smallOrderFee.text if t.smallOrderFee.confirmed else t.smallOrderFee.fallback }}{% else %}{{ t.freeOver.fallback }}{% endif %}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Timing</dt>
            <dd>{{ t.sameDay.text if t.sameDay.confirmed else t.sameDay.fallback }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Where</dt>
            <dd>
{%- for zone in delivery.zones %}
{%- set zs = business.stores | storeById(zone.storeId) %}
              <strong>{{ zs.shortName }}:</strong> {% if zone.confirmed %}{{ zone.sentence }}{% else %}{{ delivery.zoneFallback }}{% endif %}<br>
{%- endfor %}
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>ID</dt>
            <dd>{{ t.idPolicy.text }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Gifts</dt>
            <dd>{{ t.gifts.text if t.gifts.confirmed else t.gifts.fallback }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Returns</dt>
            <dd>{{ t.returns.text if t.returns.confirmed else t.returns.fallback }}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="terms-list__row">
            <dt>Special orders</dt>
            <dd>{{ t.specialOrders.text if t.specialOrders.confirmed else t.specialOrders.fallback }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Delivery Zones -->
    <section class="content-section content-section--alt">
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Delivery Zones</h2>
      <p class="content-intro">Each store delivers to its own side of town, so your order always comes from the closest shelf.</p>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="locations-grid">
{%- for zone in delivery.zones %}
{%- set zs = business.stores | storeById(zone.storeId) %}
          <div class="location-card reveal">
            <h3><a href="{{ zs.url }}">From {{ zs.shortName }}</a></h3>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-map-marker-alt"></i> {{ zs.address.street }}, {{ zs.address.locality }}, {{ zs.address.region }} {{ zs.address.postalCode }}</p>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-truck"></i> {% if zone.confirmed %}Serving {{ zone.label }}{% else %}{{ delivery.zoneFallback }}{% endif %}</p>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> <a href="{{ zs.phone.href }}">{{ zs.phone.display }}</a></p>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> {% set statusStore = zs %}{% include "partials/hours-status.njk" %}</p>
          </div>
{%- endfor %}
        </div>
        {% include "partials/zone-checker.njk" %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Curbside Pickup -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Curbside Pickup</h2>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>
          <h3>Order Ahead</h3>
          <p>Place your order online or call the store and choose pickup. We'll have it ready and waiting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i>
          <h3>Pull Up</h3>
          <p>Park out front and give us a ring at {{ business.phone.display }} to let us know you've arrived.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card reveal">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i>
          <h3>Show Your ID</h3>
          <p>We'll bring your order to the car, check your ID, and send you on your way in under a minute.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ID & Age Policy -->
    <section class="content-section content-section--alt">
      <div class="content-narrow prose">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">ID &amp; Age Policy</h2>
        <p>Monarch Liquor is a TABC-licensed retailer, and we take that seriously. Every delivery and curbside order is verified at handoff:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The person accepting the order must be <strong>21 years of age or older</strong>.</li>
          <li>A <strong>valid government-issued photo ID</strong> is required &mdash; no exceptions.</li>
          <li>We cannot leave alcohol unattended, with a minor, or with anyone who appears intoxicated.</li>
          <li>If no eligible recipient is available, the order returns to the store and our team will contact you to reschedule.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 id="faq" class="section-heading reveal">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {% set faqGroup = "delivery" %}{% include "partials/faq-list.njk" %}
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="cta-band">
      <h2><em>Thirsty, Austin?</em></h2>
      <p>Order during store hours and a Monarch driver brings it to your door.</p>
      {% order "delivery-cta", "ORDER DELIVERY", "btn-primary" %}
      <a href="/contact.html" class="btn-outline-light">CONTACT US</a>
    </section>
